      <td>//Uncertain,// r. c. 2800 BC
        <br

        (36,000 years)

      <td
        - Known from the //[[ Instructions of Shuruppak ]]// and //SKL//
        - He has been compared with [[ Atra-Hasis ]], [[ Utnapishtim ]], and [[ Noah ]]
        - Historicity uncertain

